+### Equal-send credential generation authority
+
+When a native quote send proves the persistent account state is unchanged, the
+final FULL commit preserves the exact retained credential generation instead of
+installing a fresh sealed cipher. Store rechecks receipt generation and immutable
+send identity before clearing the network block. Non-accepted results still take
+the fresh-authority path.
